+WSL root verification used (Linux-only; Windows tests do not execute):
+```sh
+setpriv --bounding-set=-dac_override,-dac_read_search env PATH=/usr/lib/rust-1.91/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/var/tmp/hiapi-issue17-target RUST_TEST_THREADS=1 bash scripts/check.sh
+```
+From the sites child worktree (or an exact Linux mirror), with a local test database:
+```sh
+bun test apps/content-api/tests/modules/review apps/content-api/tests/modules/blog apps/content-api/tests/modules/faq apps/content-api/tests/modules/changelog apps/content-api/tests/modules/model/transcribe-info.test.ts apps/content-api/tests/modules/model/content-core.test.ts packages/content-sdk/tests/schema/ingest-update-modify.test.ts packages/content-sdk/tests/schema/ingest-blog.test.ts packages/content-sdk/tests/schema/ingest-batch5.test.ts packages/content-sdk/tests/schema/ingest-model.test.ts --timeout 30000
+bun run --filter @hiapi/content-api --filter @hiapi/content-sdk --filter @hiapi/manage typecheck
+git diff --check
+```
+Changed TypeScript files additionally pass ESLint with --max-warnings 0; exact package commands/evidence belong to the sites child implementation record.
+
+## Review gates and results
+- Contract gate: CLI/API version precondition and replay fingerprint agree; no automatic retry on 409.
+- Correctness gate: protected Showcase fields, old accepted records, target IDs, other locales, publication time and no regeneration are tested.
+- Independent implementation review: completed before PR submission; null model-body deletion and legacy target matching findings fixed.
+- Baseline results: CLI 230 tests; API 571 tests / 55 files / 2080 assertions; types/lint green. Local real CLI/HTTP/DB integration passed Showcase and FAQ. API blog integration verifies original-target updates and other locales.
+- Follow-up results: CLI full gate passed again (230 Linux tests); API replay/blog regression passed (13 tests, 97 assertions), changed test lint passed. Final independent review found no new code blockers.
+- PR review gate: weil-ai requested planning/tree/blog-documentation corrections; this follow-up supplies them. Later comments must be addressed before approval.
+- Remote CI is not evidence of code failure: sites run 44658696801 had zero steps due to account billing/spending limits.
+- Live staging remains pending; local evidence is not a deployed acceptance claim. validation.md is a supplementary historical result log; this implement.md is the authoritative execution plan.
+
+## Rollback points
+1. Before writes/new revision rows: revert CLI independently; API code can revert while retaining additive schema.
+2. Once a pending revision exists: NEVER roll API acceptance back to create-only logic; disable mutation endpoints or roll forward. Keep trusted receipts and mappings.
+3. After accept: no automatic destructive rollback. Correct via a new reviewed revision; retain original accepted history.
+4. Do not remove migration tables while revision drafts/associations exist. Separate operational recovery review is required before schema removal.
